Error [E0120]: `name` was not moved here, so it cannot be returned as-is
  --> tests/ui/return_borrowed_param.jet:2:12
    |
  2 |     return name
    |            ^^^^
 Why: this function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: return a copy: `return name.clone();` — or take ownership with `take name: String`
